 A small TypeScript module exposing `createOrder(item, quantity)`.
 
+Item names are trimmed and internal whitespace is collapsed to single spaces,
+including tabs, line breaks, and Unicode whitespace. Case and punctuation are
+preserved. Empty names and quantities that are not positive integers are rejected.
+
 Run the tests with Node.js 22.14.0 or later:
 
 ```sh
